	(text "ADC_V_IN\n  ├─ BP5293-50 → +5V_D（Pico/LCD）\n  └─ MBC2596 → ~6.6V\n         ├─ LT1763-5   → +5V_A  （ADC）\n         └─ LT1763-3.3 → +3V3_A （ADC）"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 257.81 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Mgen+ 1p medium")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1c2b84b1-b2ef-4a07-a061-97e4efaa2c8e")
	)
	(text "POWER/DIGITAL: ADC_VIN->U705(MBC2596 6.6-6.8V)->U706(+3V3_A) then U707(+5V_A EN=+3V3_A). U704=+5V_D; D701 Schottky +5V_D->VSYS so USB cannot backfeed +5V_D. Y701 ASFL1->R718->ADC_MCLK (TP701; R720 1k to GP9 sense). U709 TPS3307-33D SO-8 watches +5V_A/+3V3_A, ~RESET->ADC_nRST (PP, 200ms), GP15 OD -> ~MR. U708 XC8107 LCD load-SW (LCD_EN High=ON)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 325.12 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1ef2b45d-efcb-4418-92fc-b0a48a8883d2")
	)
	(text "GP9=MCLK_SENSE は R720 1k 経由の入力専用。出力にすると Y701 と衝突して SCKI が化ける。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 171.45 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "20c6921b-fcd4-43f6-9cfc-0a14db139453")
	)
	(text "A3 Pico2 横置き: 南列 1-20 西→東 / 北列 21-40 東→西。VSYS=+5V_D via D701 ショットキ, GND=D_GND | GP0=ADC_DATA GP1=ADC_BCK GP2=ADC_LRCK | GP3/GP4=NC(旧 LCD SPI) | GP5=LCD_CS GP6=LCD_DC GP7=LCD_RST GP8=LCD_EN | GP9=MCLK_SENSE (R720 1k, 入力専用) | GP10=TP_SDA GP11=TP_SCL GP12=TP_INT GP13=TP_RST | GP15=ADC_nMR (TPS3307 ~MR, OD, H は駆動しない) | GP18=LCD_SCK GP19=LCD_MOSI (SPI0)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 171.45 213.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "215cdaa9-9e5d-46db-b7dc-7e69cf549639")
	)
	(text "LRCK/BCK の向きは ADC マスタモード想定。スレーブ時は階層ピンの方向を合わせて変更すること。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 120.142 10.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.397 1.397)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2ab50167-f6db-40e7-802a-592b708a8558")
	)
	(text "OPA1656 の各電源ペアに 100nF を配置。バルクコンデンサはアナログフロントエンドの電源入口付近に。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.066 210.312 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.397 1.397)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "51385100-3953-4fa8-b1c9-741cc6e56e73")
	)
	(text "U707 EN=+3V3_A (3V3-first). AbsMax VCC-VDD protection."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 325.628 20.828 0)
		(effects
			(font
