	)
	(text "GND: NT702=A_GND─ADC_GND（A701近傍・アナログ星点）。NT701=ADC_GND_IN─D_GND（PD入口）。Pico/LCD は D_GND のみ。D_GND は太く短く、アナログ入力から離す。計測経路は PD 基準（非絶縁完成）。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 63.246 14.478 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.397 1.397)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "72910310-bb51-4e57-b94e-36eed2e97fe3")
	)
	(text "U709=TPS3307-33D SO-8: SENSE1=+5V_A (4.55V) SENSE2=+3V3_A (2.93V) SENSE3=VDD; VDD=+3V3_A C745 100nF; ~RESET PP -> ADC_nRST + R719; GP15 OD -> ~MR (do not drive H); RESET pin NC; 200ms delay. Replaces TPS3808G33/G50 SOT-23-6."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 406.654 16.002 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "82ea3b7e-ed36-45b0-b4f0-18336be79924")
	)
